sed correctly and how problems associated with the resources are reported"},{"code":"701.4.5","text":"Explain why the organisational procedures have been developed and how they are used for the selection of required resources"},{"code":"701.4.6","text":"Describe any potential hazards associated with the resources and methods of work"},{"code":"701.4.7","text":"Describe how to calculate distances, length, quantity, length, levels and diagonals, area and wastage of materials associated with the method and procedure to set out to form masonry structures"},{"code":"701.5.1","text":"Protect the work and its surrounding area from damage in accordance with safe working practices and organisational procedures"},{"code":"701.5.2","text":"Maintain a clear and tidy work space"},{"code":"701.5.3","text":"Dispose of waste in accordance with current legislation"},{"code":"701.5.4","text":"Describe how to protect work from damage and the purpose of protection in relation to:"},{"code":"701.5.5","text":"Explain why the disposal of waste should be carried out safely in accordance with:"},{"code":"701.6.1","text":"Demonstrate completion of the work within the estimated allocated time"},{"code":"701.6.2","text":"Describe the purpose of the work programme and explain why deadlines should be kept in relation to:"},{"code":"701.7.1","text":"Demonstrate the following work skills when setting out to form masonry structures:"},{"code":"701.7.2","text":"Use and maintain hand and power tools and setting out equipment"},{"code":"701.7.3","text":"Determine dimensions and positions using line, level, depth, area, height and angle to given working instructions to establish at least four of the following lines:"},{"code":"701.7.4","text":"Describe how to apply safe and healthy work practices, follow procedures, report problems and establish the authority needed to rectify them, to:"},{"code":"701.7.5","text":"Describe the needs of other occupations and how to communicate effectively within a team 